  "description": "ISO-TP (ISO 15765-2) protocol implementation for .NET 11. ISOTPProtocol manages named ISOTPService address pairs and exposes three Rx observables: CanTX (raw CAN frames to transmit), MessageReceived (reassembled inbound payloads), and MessageTransmitted (outbound payloads). Supports single-frame, first-frame, consecutive-frame, and flow-control-frame types with automatic TX padding to 8 bytes.",
